// armmask bit a = case runs in arm a. Bits: 0 EXP 1 NOEP-COLD
// 2 NOEP-WARM-A 3 NOEP-WARM-B 4 DEV-NOEP 5 DEV 6 DEV-ABL
// 7 ABC 8 BCA 9 CAB 10 INT
// xhow -1 means the how channel is not scored.
